# Aurum adaptation: Night Elf Druid, southern questing, dungeon interleaving.

step Fishin' Time on arrival
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Visit Gilbert Gray while still at the harbor, before going to the flight master. Use the Shiny Bauble and three Nightcrawlers bought from Nessa in Rut'theran. If either is missing, the shopping goals point to Catherine Leland beside the Trade District canal; buy the missing supplies before returning to Gilbert. No fishing skill is required.
  buy 6529 x1 npc 5494 quest 95065
  buy 6530 x3 npc 5494 quest 95065
  accept 95065
  turnin 95065

step Arrive in Stormwind
  tip Climb the harbor stairs and visit Dungar Longdrink in the Trade District gryphon roost. Use the ramp inside to reach him.
  getfp "Stormwind" npc 352
  train class

step Westfall pickup eligibility
  tip Finish your Bear Form training before continuing.
  level 10

step Goldshire supplies and Westfall report
  zone Elwynn Forest
  sethome "Goldshire" npc 295 -- Set your Hearthstone at Innkeeper Farley before heading east.
  vendor 295 -- Sell low-value loot at the inn. Keep skinning leather, cloth for First Aid, and route quest items.
  note Refill to 10-20 Ice Cold Milk, or as many as you can afford after reserving spell-training and flight money. Food is useful between pulls; carry a small stack. The purchase below is a reminder, not a demand to replace supplies you already own.
  buy 1179 x20 npc 295 optional
  accept 109 npc 240 lvl 9 -- Carry Marshal Dughan's report west to Sentinel Hill.

step Goldshire: the eastern outdoor circuit
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Take Marshal Dughan's report to Guard Thomas at the eastern bridge.
  accept 40 lvl 7
  turnin 40
  accept 35 lvl 7

step Guard Thomas and the river tools
  tip Follow the eastern road to the bridge. Speak to Thomas and Ormin, then gather the waterlogged saw, axe and toolbox in that order in the river just downstream. Return the tools before heading north to Eastvale.
  turnin 35
  accept 37 lvl 7
  accept 52 lvl 7
  accept 91733 lvl 7
  collect 247813 quest 91733.2
  collect 247817 quest 91733.1
  collect 247818 quest 91733.3
  turnin 91733

step Eastvale Logging Camp
  tip Take Sara's bandana task and Raelen's timber request. Gather the loose wood around the logging camp while skinning the wolves and bears needed for Thomas; no profession gathering skill is required for the wood.
  accept 83 lvl 4
  accept 5545 lvl 5
  collect 13872 quest 5545.1
  kill 118 quest 52.1
  kill 822 quest 52.2
  turnin 5545

step The lost guards and lake bandits
  tip Inspect the half-eaten body by the river, then Rolf's body in the murloc camp by Stone Cairn Lake. Clear the immediate guards instead of rushing between packs. Gather bandanas from the nearby Defias while travelling between the two bodies.
  turnin 37
  accept 45 lvl 7
  turnin 45
  accept 71 lvl 7
  collect 1019 npc 474 quest 83.1

step Eastvale and the bridge: finish every local task
  tip Return Sara's bandanas, then finish both reports at Guard Thomas. Take his final report back to Goldshire.
  turnin 83
  turnin 52
  turnin 71
  accept 39 lvl 7

step Goldshire: the finished report
  turnin 39
  vendor 295 -- Sell junk and refill drinks.

step Goldshire: the armor delivery
  tip Marshal Dughan now offers Cloth and Leather Armor for Sara Timberlain. Carry it on the extra eastern circuit; this is a delivery, not a crafting requirement.
  accept 59

step Blixie Fitzwink: stolen supplies
  tip Stop at Blixie on the eastern road and accept Stolen Enchanting Supplies. The crates are outdoors around Stone Cairn Lake; no profession is required.
  accept 91725

step Guard Thomas: the murloc bounty
  tip After delivering his report to Goldshire, Thomas offers Bounty on Murlocs. Take it before returning to the lake.
  accept 46

step Eastvale: deliver the armor request
  turnin 59

step Stone Cairn Lake: supplies and fins
  tip Collect five supply crates around the lake and fins from Murloc Lurkers, levels 9-10. Pull from the camp edge and avoid named enemies.
  collect 247805 quest 91725.1
  collect 780 npc 732 quest 46.1

step Guard Thomas and Blixie: claim the rewards
  tip Return the fins to Thomas, then follow the road west to Blixie with the supply crates.
  turnin 46
  turnin 91725

step Prepare for the Hall of Thanes
  tip Return to Goldshire. Sell junk and refill drinks at the inn.
  vendor 295

